Subject: EVO-X2 Preflight Producer Effect Wrapper Hash Case Refresh Fault

@ [fault_uuid] 304ca5d8-01fe-422b-aecb-a3dda31534a3
@ [conversation_uuid] 01a02268-2614-7d80-9737-ea77f4aeacb1
@ [timestamp_ms] 1789143748537
@ [turn_uuid] 54e1915d-41d9-4941-86e0-56a96d84ec69

& [Fault]
  + after transitive rehash reported 128 manifests 3343 references zero stale the dedicated effect-wrapper verifier refused its updated plan artifact SHA256 because the generic rehasher had written uppercase hexadecimal while the dedicated manifest contract requires lowercase

& [Containment]
  + publication remained paused and no source implementation commission provider remote or host effect proceeded
  + producer evidence itself continued to pass under PowerShell7 and WindowsPowerShell5.1

& [Resolution]
  + reran the dedicated effect-wrapper evidence builder with exact gates so its canonical producer restored lowercase artifact digests
  + reran its verifier under both PowerShell generations then reran dependency-ordered rehash and verify-only at 128 manifests 3343 references zero stale
  + reran the producer verifier under both PowerShell generations successfully

& [Lesson]
  + when a leaf manifest has a stricter lexical hash contract than the generic dependency rehasher its own canonical builder must run before the recursive parent refresh
